## Verdict

Asked whether the record determines the window, the block answers with
a split decision computed to the coordinate: the barrier is the
record, the depth is gauge, the extent is forced up to a scale the
axioms genuinely do not pick, and the normalization was never a window
coordinate at all — a kernel coupling wearing window clothes. The
checker sharpened both edges: the surviving freedom is wider than the
primary said (every dilation of the support passes every declared
requirement), and the negative is harder than the primary said (no
record-determined window can be disjoint from the barrier, as a
theorem). What GBW1 leaves behind now has its correct addresses: a
scale principle, a convention, one identification carrying real
weight, and a joint obligation with the kernel block. Independent
audit still required.
